nge are included here; no separate documentation work is part of this\n51\t  epic.\n52\t\n53\t## Acceptance Criteria\n54\t\n55\t- Given the Dashboard, when a user opens the tutorial gallery, then the curated\n56\t  tutorials are listed with their packaged metadata.\n57\t- Given a notebook tutorial in the gallery, when the user clicks launch, then a\n58\t  workbench opens in the user's project with the tutorial notebook loaded.\n59\t- Given a pipeline tutorial in the gallery, when the user clicks launch, then the\n60\t  pipeline is imported into the user's project.\n61\t- The gallery renders and launches tutorials packaged in the tutorial packaging\n62\t  format; a tutorial package can be updated without a Dashboard release and the\n63\t  gallery picks it up.\n64\t- Launch behavior is verified end-to-end against at least one packaged notebook\n65\t  tutorial and one packaged pipeline tutorial.\n66\t\n67\t## HLR Traceability\n68\t\n69\t- HLR-1 (P0): \"The Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can launch a\n70\t  tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the notebook, or importing\n71\t  the pipeline).\" This epic delivers the gallery and its launch mechanics.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-875930423f746ab9","agent_id":"ada5988a28cfc52e5","session_id":"6f9618b5-3632-482b-87dd-54640f671069","uuid":"13e5430f-f83f-4eac-a5ed-776411fb8457","timestamp":"2026-10-26T21:40:26.999Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-808838d04df14bda","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
